                <pb facs="0238" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg142"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Friends of American missionaries at Paotingfu are solicitous on account of press
                    reports. Are they adequately protected?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
